  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has releases the answer key for the post of Junior Engineer JE<span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;</span>on the official website of the UPSSSC. This recruitment was released for 4612 posts.&nbsp; Online applying process for UPSSSC Junior Engineer JE Recruitment 2024 were accepted from 07 May 2024 &amp; the candidates can apply till the 13 July 2024. The examination was held on 03 May 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their UPSSSC Junior Engineer JE Answer Key 2026 which has given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Service Selection Board (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Junior Engineer JE Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt No. : 08-Exam/2024</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Start : <strong>07 May 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date for Apply : <strong>13 July 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; 