ont-size: 12pt;\">1716</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.1041%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.1041%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">368</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.1041%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.1041%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">1514</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.1041%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.1041%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">924</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.1041%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.1041%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">45</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPSSSC Junior Engineer JE Recruitment 2024 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Diploma in Civil Engineering <strong>Or</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">BE / B.Tech Degree in Civil Engineering</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET 2023 Score Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Junior Engineer JE Online Form 2024 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Interview (Viva-Voce)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Instruction for Downloading the UPSSSC Junior Engineer JE Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download Answer Key link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the answer key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate can also download it from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n